## 3. 用户偏好接口（FR-v0.2-33）
--- GET 初始 ---
{"code":0,"codeName":"OK","message":"OK","data":{"theme":"light"},"success":true}
--- PUT theme=dark ---
{"code":0,"codeName":"OK","message":"OK","data":{"theme":"dark"},"success":true}
--- GET 回读（换设备登录拿到的是这个值）---
{"code":0,"codeName":"OK","message":"OK","data":{"theme":"dark"},"success":true}
--- PUT 非法键（应 40001）---
{"code":40001,"codeName":"INVALID_ARGUMENT","message":"不支持的偏好键：is_admin","data":null,"success":false}
--- PUT 非法值（应 40001）---
{"code":40001,"codeName":"INVALID_ARGUMENT","message":"偏好值非法：theme=rainbow","data":null,"success":false}

